2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-1017) 'This fork takes a name, a mark and identifiers of its own.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1017) 'Upstream reserves its names and its orbital clock logo artwork. Its terms require a rebrand for each fork.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1017) 'Check that the server accepts `weftspun_image_to_world`, or Image to World tasks fail.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-1017) 'Fork rebrand to Weftspun
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-1017) 'This repository takes the name Weftspun 3D Studio. The code token is Weftspun3DStudio. The package name is weftspun-3d-studio. The Electron identifier is com.weftspun.studio. The Android identifier is com.weftspun.xrfacebridge.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1017) 'A new mark replaces the upstream artwork. The new mark shows a woven warp and weft lattice. A rename alone does not satisfy the upstream terms, because the terms reserve the artwork itself.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-1017) 'The repository keeps the upstream repository links. These links give credit to the upstream authors. Nominative credit does not claim any affiliation.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-1017) 'See `DETAILS.md` for the compatibility fallbacks, the known risks, and file references.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-1017) 'RFD66606-1018 records the M3 documentation removal.
 # tags: rfd:related
