2026-08-25T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-1017) 'The rebrand renames one backend model identifier. The client sends weftspun_image_to_world to the 3DAIGC-API server. The server must accept the new name. Image to World tasks fail until then.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-1017) 'The face bridge APK changes its application identifier. A headset installs the APK as a new application. Users must delete the old APK.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written

