2026-08-25T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-1017) 'Upstream reserves the names "Space-Time" and "OpenNexus3DStudio". A fork must remove the upstream names, logos, and trade dress. A fork must then take a unique name.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1017  1 LINE
 Text:Written
